      "title": "After party @ Sala Bikini | July 18th, open doors 21:30",
      "description": "🎉BIG ANNOUNCEMENT 🎉\n\nWe've officially selected Sala Bikini as the venue for the conference after-party on July 18th. Ever since the 1950s, it's one of the most iconic clubs in Barcelona. One of the main features is their concerts.\n\nWe are excited to announce that EmpathyTest will be playing the official after-party on Thursday 18th July at the Sala Bikini, Barcelona. Gonna be fantastic experience 🤩\n\nIt has been a challenge to book a venue for the after-party with +600 attendees. Sala Bikini entrance is next to our conference venue. No need to take any taxi, just relax after the amazing talks and meet your peers! \n\n#JSCamp #Barcelona #JavaScript",
